Leftpad OS includes software derived from left-pad 1.3.0:

  https://github.com/left-pad/left-pad/tree/v1.3.0

left-pad was originally authored by Azer Koçulu and later maintained by Steve Mao
and other contributors. Its repository and package metadata distribute version
1.3.0 under the MIT License. The upstream copyright notice is preserved in
LICENSE.

The upstream index.js also contains a file-level notice for the Do What The Fuck
You Want To Public License, Version 2. That notice is preserved verbatim at the
top of index.js.

The runtime implementation in index.js remains functionally equivalent to the
upstream implementation. Package identity, documentation, and tests have been
adapted for Leftpad OS.
